All derived from the room log and groups.state (group-room-status.ts, pure).

* test(e2e): live gateway-owned room spec with scripted tool calls and failures

The mock inference server learns E2E_TOOL(<handle>)[<tool>:<command>] (a
member's first completion calls a tool) and E2E_FAIL(<handle>) (HTTP 401),
and group-scripted completions honour holdFirstCompletionContaining.
