owner entry; the dashboard worker reads shared-state.db), so delivery reported success while the
visible room got nothing and mentioned bots never ran.

The session store now counts only when its gateway holds the room's owner entry
(probe_native_room_owner, read-only and non-blocking like probe_hosted_room); otherwise delivery
falls back to the shared store. The test fixture's room moves to the shared store (where a room
without an owner entry is actually served), plus tests for both-copies and natively-owned rooms.

