* fix(state): count the repo test runner as a pytest ancestor

Under the runner's fork server a test process descends from the runner and
the fork server, not from a python -m pytest process, so the live-DB guard's
ancestry fallback found no pytest above a child with a scrubbed environment
(tests/hermes_state/test_live_db_guard_ancestry.py). The runner only runs
